OL,3,GNEWSATrio jailed for revenge attack in
OL,4,Apub
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree men who launched a revenge attack
OL,7,Fin a pub, which left their victim
OL,8,Fbleeding from the head, have each been
OL,9,Fjailed for three years four months.
OL,11,FCameron George, Rory George and Leon
OL,12,FFinegan struck the man with weapons
OL,13,Fincluding a baton at a bar in Redcar in
OL,14,FMarch, in what Teesside Crown Court
OL,15,Fheard was a "premeditated and planned"
OL,16,Fassault.
OL,18,FJudge Joanne Kidd said it was clear the
OL,19,Ftrio made "repeated and persistent"
OL,20,Fattempts to strike the man in the head,
OL,21,Fwith his wound resulting in a pool of
OL,22,Fblood forming on the bar floor.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,393,390,260,160,0,100
